        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BSE100TEKFAL, Offset 1\" Square Teak Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOne of today's hottest trends is adding natural touches to modern decor. The 1 Inch Offset Square Solid Teak Door Pull features a contemporary shape with a solid wood grip. Teak is especially great for use on exterior doors because it is weather resistant. This door handle is unfinished, allowing the natural beauty of the wood to shine through. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The offset wrap around square mounts are available in a huge selection of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Modern Teak Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BSE01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First Impressions Teak Door Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BSE100012TEKFAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100024TEKFAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100036TEKFALK:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
