                "title": "1 Inch Offset Square Solid Wood Door Pull",
                "description": "One of today's hottest trends is adding natural touches to modern decor. The 1 Inch Offset Square Solid Teak Door Pull features a contemporary shape with a solid wood grip. Teak is especially great for use on exterior doors because it is weather resistant. This door handle is unfinished, allowing the natural beauty of the wood to shine through. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The offset wrap around square mounts are available in a huge selection of finishes.",
